# Initalise the image worker as a singleton instance
# Each instance of the worker needs a java instance, so its more efficient to have one instance which handles all of the calls.
If not(coImageWorker.$validref())
	OK message Starting JVM {Java needs to start, this may take a few moments}
	Do $objects.oImageWorker.$newref() Returns coImageWorker
	
	# Actually start the worker. For this use case, we don't need any special parameters
	Do coImageWorker.$init()
	Do coImageWorker.$start()
End If